      ],
      "content": "SP 81 NW 1/34 BIERTON WITH BROUGHTON AYLESBURY ROAD (north side) No. 202 (Formerly listed as Corner Farmhouse) II House. C17 timber framed refronted in red and some blue brick C18, old tiled roof hipped on left with large central chimney stack with projecting bands and shaft. Small stack at S. end. Moulded brick eaves cornice. 2-storeys, door in modern gabled porch opposite main chimney stack. 4- light bay window with tiled lean-to roof on right, 3-light casements to left. Two 3-light upper casements. Rear (east) elevation has four upper casements and irregular ground floor openings and slated 1-storey addition. Some timber framing to gables. RCHM I p.50 MON.10. Listing NGR: SP8447215932"
    }
